   "source": [
    "## Section 7 \u2014 Publication-quality figures\n",
    "\n",
    "Consistent styling, 300 dpi, saved as **PNG + PDF**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "id": "cell-17",
   "source": [
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
